description: How to test the code
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing tests, try to reuse code by using pytest parametrization. Also, when test data are repeated often, extract them to a fixture and/or a constant.

When running python tests, always call pytest using poetry like this:

```bash
poetry run pytest
```

This ensures that the tests are run with the correct environment and dependencies.
